{"id": "housing-block-grant-eviction-defense-audit", "title": "Auditors could not verify Eviction Defense Collaborative’s federal block-grant charges", "seconds": 98.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "22aa633894235183", "words": 238, "beats": [{"scene": "program", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "San Francisco passed federal block grants to Eviction Defense Collaborative for tenant services.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.28, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "did", "the", "auditor", "need", "to", "see?"], "sub": "Eviction Defense Collaborative"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.94, 1.37, 1.77, 2.08, 2.84, 3.04, 3.53, 4.01, 4.88, 5.1, 5.46]}, {"scene": "program", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Collaborative reported 3,589,571 dollars in federal expenditures.", "t0": 6.4, "t1": 11.92, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,589,571", "label": "HUD block-grant expenditures for FY2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 1.12, 1.57, 1.83, 2.25, 2.63, 3.09, 3.57, 4.08, 4.27, 4.67]}, {"scene": "program", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Most went to tenant legal services. The remainder supported emergency rental assistance program delivery.", "t0": 12.04, "t1": 18.6, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "FY2024 award schedule", "heading": "Two programs under one grant cluster", "source": "audit24", "rows": [{"icon": "fund", "label": "Tenant Right to Counsel", "value": "$3,223,591"}, {"icon": "fund", "label": "Emergency rental assistance program delivery", "value": "$365,980"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.71, 0.97, 1.08, 1.41, 1.72, 3.02, 3.21, 3.65, 4.14, 4.73, 5.06, 5.6, 6.05]}, {"scene": "draws", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The nonprofit reported 3,223,591 dollars in right to counsel expenditures.", "t0": 18.82, "t1": 24.85, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit24", "kicker": "O’Connor & Company / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "FY2024 award schedule", "mark": "FY2024 award schedule"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.79, 1.3, 1.61, 2.05, 2.39, 2.7, 3.12, 4.11, 4.36, 4.64, 4.79, 5.23]}, {"scene": "draws", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The City’s federal performance report lists twelve draw vouchers for the same grant.", "t0": 24.97, "t1": 29.61, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "HUD voucher report", "heading": "City program year 2023", "source": "caper", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Distinct vouchers", "value": "12"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Federal draws", "value": "$1,325,189.05"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.58, 0.98, 1.51, 1.94, 2.27, 2.8, 3.11, 3.54, 3.68, 3.81, 4.2]}, {"scene": "draws", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The City’s budget analyst said the grant was 73 percent housing trust fund and 27 percent federal.", "t0": 29.73, "t1": 36.27, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "budget", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Housing Trust Fund and block grant", "mark": "Housing Trust Fund and block grant"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.54, 0.89, 1.3, 1.59, 1.72, 2.08, 2.27, 2.98, 3.38, 3.8, 4.08, 4.69, 5.01, 5.72, 6.11]}, {"scene": "draws", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "The city payment ledger matches the federal draw total to the cent.", "t0": 36.39, "t1": 40.04, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,325,189.05", "label": "City and federal draw totals"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.5, 0.9, 1.32, 1.76, 1.87, 2.27, 2.6, 3.0, 3.11, 3.24]}, {"scene": "opinion", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditor could not verify how costs had been allocated to the federal program.", "t0": 40.26, "t1": 44.89, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit24", "kicker": "O’Connor & Company / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "Finding 2024-002", "mark": "Finding 2024-002"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.64, 0.9, 1.21, 1.83, 2.11, 2.69, 2.81, 2.99, 3.46, 3.57, 3.68, 4.06]}, {"scene": "opinion", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "That left the auditor unable to give an opinion on compliance with the grant requirements.", "t0": 45.01, "t1": 49.82, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Disclaimer of opinion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.56, 0.68, 1.2, 1.72, 1.83, 2.05, 2.16, 2.69, 2.94, 3.55, 3.69, 3.8, 4.06]}, {"scene": "opinion", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The federal filing flagged questioned costs. The report gives no questioned dollar amount.", "t0": 49.94, "t1": 55.67, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fac", "kicker": "Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "Questioned costs", "mark": "Questioned costs"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.65, 1.19, 1.65, 2.22, 3.22, 3.39, 3.86, 4.17, 4.45, 5.0, 5.35]}, {"scene": "opinion", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The auditor gave a separate unmodified opinion on the financial statements.", "t0": 55.79, "t1": 60.04, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "financial", "kicker": "O’Connor & Company / Eviction Defense Collaborative", "text": "Financial statements", "mark": "Financial statements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.69, 0.92, 1.02, 1.49, 2.3, 2.83, 2.94, 3.05, 3.59]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Collaborative said it hired a new controller and a new professional accounting firm.", "t0": 60.26, "t1": 65.47, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit24", "kicker": "O’Connor & Company / Federal Audit Clearinghouse", "text": "Management response", "mark": "Management response"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.95, 1.29, 1.44, 1.86, 1.96, 2.17, 3.09, 3.34, 3.44, 3.7, 4.4, 4.9]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The fiscal 2023 audit found a weakness in financial reporting for deferred revenue.", "t0": 65.59, "t1": 71.92, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit23", "kicker": "O’Connor & Company / Eviction Defense Collaborative", "text": "FY2023 audit", "mark": "FY2023 audit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.74, 1.16, 1.91, 2.66, 2.92, 3.02, 3.49, 3.62, 4.13, 5.05, 5.27, 5.83]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The auditor reported no federal award findings that year.", "t0": 72.04, "t1": 75.35, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Federal awards"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.67, 1.21, 1.52, 1.95, 2.32, 2.76, 2.97]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The City found support for the invoices it tested. Its standard on current audit findings remained unmet.", "t0": 75.47, "t1": 82.18, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "monitor", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller", "text": "December 2025 monitoring", "mark": "December 2025 monitoring"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.48, 0.79, 1.33, 1.47, 1.6, 2.2, 2.32, 3.43, 3.67, 4.26, 4.47, 4.83, 5.15, 5.67, 6.14]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "The next financial audit repeated a separate issue with reconciling liabilities.", "t0": 82.3, "t1": 87.13, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "fy25", "kicker": "O’Connor & Company / Eviction Defense Collaborative", "text": "FY2025 financial statements", "mark": "FY2025 financial statements"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.49, 1.05, 1.37, 1.82, 1.92, 2.35, 2.99, 3.25, 4.0]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "After reconciliation, the differences were immaterial.", "t0": 87.25, "t1": 90.55, "shot": "r16", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Immaterial differences"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 1.82, 1.97, 2.47, 2.65]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records do not establish an amount disallowed or repaid.", "t0": 90.67, "t1": 94.32, "shot": "r17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Grant costs", "Amount repaid"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.72, 0.94, 1.55, 1.65, 2.03, 2.8, 3.01]}, {"scene": "response", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 94.44, "t1": 97.08, "shot": "r18", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.46, 0.92, 1.11, 1.41, 1.49, 1.6, 1.86, 2.17]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"program": "Where the grant went", "draws": "Two records of the right-to-counsel grant", "opinion": "What the records could establish", "response": "What changed afterwards"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "document"}